{
  "name": "Speed-to-Lead: instant text-back, AI call-back, CRM, follow-ups",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Speed-to-lead (Blue Gable Roofing demo)\nA new lead gets an SMS text-back and an AI call-back within seconds, is logged in the CRM, and enters a follow-up sequence (text at 5 min, call at 1 h, text next day) that stops on reply, answered call, or STOP.\n\nAll rules (quiet hours, consent, dedup, retries, opt-out) live in the decision service (`npm start`). This workflow only moves data. See README.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 520
      },
      "id": "e2224c94-1b57-4b43-a066-d576f858179e",
      "name": "Note: overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -460,
        -420
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Setup\n1. Set env vars from `.env.example` (base URLs default to the mock server).\n2. Create 3 credentials and select them on the red nodes: **Twilio** (Basic Auth: Account SID / Auth Token), **Vapi** (Header Auth: `Authorization` = `Bearer <key>`), **CRM** (Header Auth: `Authorization` = `Bearer <token>`).\n3. Facebook: Graph API credential on *Fetch lead from Graph API*.\n4. Reactivation webhook: Header Auth credential.\n5. Activate.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 560
      },
      "id": "71e8ee54-f34c-49d4-af92-04a3ef863fba",
      "name": "Note: setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
